{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.36] Bitch, I'm in Greece like Zeus, uh-huh (Ayy, KBeaZy, you fired up)\n[00:05.04] Yeah, uh, Raf Simons on my shoe, uh\n[00:06.78] Margiela on my shoe, uh\n[00:08.60] Murakami on my shoe\n[00:10.26] One-of-one, these are not for you\n[00:12.00] Too high, I can’t talk to you (Let's go, let's go)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:14.50] To all my exes that wanna be friends\n[00:16.32] Boo-thing lame ’cause I'm not them\n[00:18.14] You see me walking around in your rent\n[00:19.70] In this Burberry poncho, it look like a tent\n[00:21.60] Audemar on my wrist, I'ma ball on a bitch, spend it all on my bitch ass (Cake)\n[00:25.08] Nah, I'm lyin', I ain't spend it all 'cause I'm rich, I be handlin’ my business (Hooray)\n[Chorus]\n[00:28.88] In the studio all night long\n[00:30.30] Want the ooh-nah-nah when I get home\n[00:32.56] Oh yeah, hold mе close, you got that good\n[00:35.42] You would make me feel rich еven if I was broke, that’s on the hood\n[00:38.82] And you understand me, I ain't have to show you the ropes\n[00:41.28] I’m so misunderstood\n[Verse 2]\n[00:44.24] Ayy, I love daily trips to the bank\n[00:46.70] I sit in the passenger seat while you drive, you hate when I drive, and I drink\n[00:50.16] Cut one of my day-one niggas off, so I wanna listen to Drake\n[00:53.80] Talking 'bout that Thank Me Later, how the fame'll make 'em change\n[00:57.50] I’m done doing niggas favors\n[00:59.20] I'm just focused on collecting paper and loving my baby and starting a label\n[01:02.84] Gotta watch who you let grab a seat and a plate, they can't eat, ain't no fakes at the table\n[01:06.48] Gotta cut 'em off, give 'em the razor\n[01:08.34] It's a shock when they switch on you, taser\n[01:10.06] I wear that pain like a mask, Darth Vader\n[Chorus]\n[01:12.42] In the studio all night long\n[01:13.30] Want the ooh-nah-nah when I get home\n[01:16.26] Oh yeah, hold me close, you got that good\n[01:19.06] You would make me feel rich even if I was broke, that's on the hood\n